  skos:related <https://mlsysbook.ai/taxonomy/concept/mlsys.generalization> ;
  skos:related <https://mlsysbook.ai/taxonomy/concept/mlsys.membership-inference> ;
  skos:related <https://mlsysbook.ai/taxonomy/concept/mlsys.overfitting> ;
  skos:related <https://mlsysbook.ai/taxonomy/concept/mlsys.catastrophic-forgetting> .

<https://mlsysbook.ai/taxonomy/concept/mlsys.batch-size> a skos:Concept ;
