  skos:related <https://mlsysbook.ai/taxonomy/concept/mlsys.scaling-laws> ;
  skos:related <https://mlsysbook.ai/taxonomy/concept/mlsys.early-stopping> .

<https://mlsysbook.ai/taxonomy/concept/mlsys.transfer-learning> a skos:Concept ;
