  skos:related <https://mlsysbook.ai/taxonomy/concept/mlsys.cost-per-token> ;
  skos:related <https://mlsysbook.ai/taxonomy/concept/mlsys.latency-throughput-curve> .

<https://mlsysbook.ai/taxonomy/concept/mlsys.admission> a skos:Concept ;
