  skos:related <https://mlsysbook.ai/taxonomy/concept/mlsys.metrics> ;
  skos:related <https://mlsysbook.ai/taxonomy/concept/mlsys.multiple-comparisons> ;
  skos:related <https://mlsysbook.ai/taxonomy/concept/mlsys.selection-bias> .

<https://mlsysbook.ai/taxonomy/concept/mlsys.sliced-evaluation> a skos:Concept ;
